{"2260510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plastic Men: War never changes", "steam_appid": 2260510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plastic Men: War never changes is a single-player shooter inspired by old PS1-era games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:<br>- Diverse levels set in a residential building and its surroundings<br>- Several types of weapons<br>- Enemy soldiers who definitely don't like you<br><br>About the developer: <br>This game was made by one person. I used some tools from marketplaces because I can't do everything myself or simply because I don't have the time, but I still tried to make the game look original. I remember the golden age of the PS1, and the &quot;Army Men&quot; games were especially fond of them, because I played with soldiers as a 10-year-old. This game is my tribute to that era, to that wonderful time when I was young. And now, several decades later, based on those old childhood fantasy games, I've made a game that I hope you'll enjoy and that will take you back to those days of youth. Thank you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plastic Men: War never changes is a single-player shooter inspired by old PS1-era games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:<br>- Diverse levels set in a residential building and its surroundings<br>- Several types of weapons<br>- Enemy soldiers who definitely don't like you<br><br>About the developer: <br>This game was made by one person. I used some tools from marketplaces because I can't do everything myself or simply because I don't have the time, but I still tried to make the game look original. I remember the golden age of the PS1, and the &quot;Army Men&quot; games were especially fond of them, because I played with soldiers as a 10-year-old. This game is my tribute to that era, to that wonderful time when I was young. And now, several decades later, based on those old childhood fantasy games, I've made a game that I hope you'll enjoy and that will take you back to those days of youth. Thank you.</p>", "short_description": "This is a simple and addictive shooter in which you play as a plastic soldier and complete various tasks. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of childhood, defeating your enemies, because war never changes!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, German, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish, Japanese, Serbian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2260510/debf61502af332142f9bbff868d039270326f843/header.jpg?t=1788194626", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2260510/1f2a219e63b00c3ec99d56f9ef6307c4eeb18635/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788194626", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2260510/1f2a219e63b00c3ec99d56f9ef6307c4eeb18635/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788194626", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel  Core i5-5675<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 Super<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><stro